{"id":"d8d33d47202e6d60","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-godel-set.md","title":"Gödel Set","display":"df-godel-set — Gödel Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-godel-set","aliases":["92-df-godel-set"],"display":"df-godel-set — Gödel Set","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-encoding-completeness]]"],"source":"原书第 V 章 pp.56–60 的算术表达与可表示性概念；本地 Express/ProvCode 及定理码呈现，与原书原生 SRep/CRep 区分","source_status":"原书相关数码概念的本地实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-godel-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-godel-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-godel-set — Gödel Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书第 V 章 pp.56–60 的算术表达与可表示性概念；本地 Express/ProvCode 及定理码呈现，与原书原生 SRep/CRep 区分"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关数码概念的本地实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (Gödel-code image, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (external provability-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span> (proof-code predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}_G\\)</span> (decoder on legal expression codes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" href=\"?note=bb4321f7cd8a5eb1\" title=\"92-df-encoding-completeness\">92-df-encoding-completeness</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span> (definition-target theorem-code set)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nK_G\\coloneqq\n\\{m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\mid\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(m)\\}\n=\n\\{m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\mid\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}godel\\text{-}set}\\vdash\nK_G\\coloneqq\n\\{m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\mid\\mathrm{ProvCode}_G(m)\\}\n=\n\\{m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\mid\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span> : Gödel集（可证句子的Gödel数集）</li>\n<li>对<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\">\\(m\\in\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in K_G\">\\(m\\in K_G\\)</span>当且仅当存在以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>为末式码的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-证明码；合法码对应的句子是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}_G(m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}_G(m)\\)</span>，不使用全域未定义的“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner^{-1}\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner^{-1}\\)</span>”</li>\n<li>当外部证明检查关系有效时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\">\\(K_G\\)</span>是c.e.集（可枚举证明码并投影其末式码）</li>\n<li>“不可判定”“多一完全”“创造”以及<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_G\\equiv_m K\">\\(K_G\\equiv_m K\\)</span>都不是本定义或单凭句子不完备性自动给出的结论；它们需要针对具体、充分强且相容的有效理论另行证明</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",